OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FScattered showers in the north,
OL,6,Fwith a few bright or sunny intervals
OL,7,Fbetween showers. Dry and brighter in
OL,8,Fthe south with some sunshine. Feeling
OL,9,Fcold.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FAny showers across the north
OL,12,Fmostly dying out. Otherwise it will be
OL,13,Fa dry and cold night with clear skies
OL,14,Fand widespread sharp frost. Light
OL,15,Fwinds.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSaturday:FAfter a frosty start it will
OL,18,Fbe a dry and cold day with plenty of
OL,19,Fsunshine. Chance of an odd shower
OL,20,Facross Harris and Lewis.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
