OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FDry
OL,6,Fwith sunny spells on Sunday and
OL,7,FMonday. Rain perhaps arriving from the
OL,8,Fwest on Monday evening and lingering
OL,9,Fsomewhat through Tuesday. Breezy in
OL,10,Fthe west.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
